[{"text": "林舟不会游泳，也从不上船，因此她总是在渡口等人，从不渡河。以后凡写到林舟，都须遵守此设定：她只在渡口（岸边）等待，不登船、不游水。", "cause": {"kind": "author_request"}, "state": "current", "title": "林舟：不游泳、不上船", "origin": "author_request", "version": 1, "entry_type": "character", "project_id": "01a1e4f0-6681-7043-80ef-4410994c60d7", "description": "林舟不会游泳，从不上船，总在渡口等人", "recorded_at": "2026-11-16T15:20:07.844045+00:00", "entry_number": 1, "memory_entry_id": "01a1e4f1-b3a7-74b0-bee3-488598c22e41", "memory_revision": 1, "source_references": [{"kind": "conversation", "run_id": "01a1e4f1-948e-7921-a228-4847c1779054", "tool_call_id": "01a1e4f1-b3a7-74b0-bee3-488598c22e41", "conversation_id": "01a1e4f1-948e-7921-a228-48344f3569c9"}]}, {"text": "林舟其实会游泳，小时候常在河里游。十年前一次落水后，她留下心理阴影，从此再也不肯上船，但仍会到渡口等人（如等姐姐林雪从对岸回来）。关键区分：她不是\"不会水\"，而是\"抗拒上船\"。", "cause": {"kind": "author_request"}, "state": "current", "title": "林舟：会游泳，不肯上船", "origin": "author_request", "version": 2, "entry_type": "character", "project_id": "01a1e4f0-6681-7043-80ef-4410994c60d7", "description": "林舟会游泳，幼时常在河里游；十年前落水后再也不肯上船，仍在渡口等人", "recorded_at": "2026-11-16T15:24:17.202833+00:00", "entry_number": 1, "memory_entry_id": "01a1e4f1-b3a7-74b0-bee3-488598c22e41", "memory_revision": 2, "source_references": [{"kind": "conversation", "run_id": "01a1e4f5-47ee-7db3-868a-cbb8175cd0b7", "tool_call_id": "01a1e4f5-81a6-7de0-a2d1-49ecc007709f", "conversation_id": "01a1e4f5-47ee-7db3-868a-cba406f75cca"}]}]
